// Berry Blade recorded sound effects (WAV, 32 kHz mono), embedded so they play even when the game is opened straight from the folder.
// Every recording here is CC0 (a public domain dedication): free for any use, commercial included, with no licence, fee or credit needed.
//   slash: "Swishes Sound Pack" by artisticdude, CC0 (recorded with a clothes hanger and sticks of wood: a swing, not a blade's ring)
//     https://opengameart.org/content/swishes-sound-pack
//   clash, parry: "20 sword sound effects (attacks and clashes)" by StarNinjas, CC0
//     https://opengameart.org/content/20-sword-sound-effects-attacks-and-clashes
//   hit, impact, block, crack, thud, wood, and the landings (land_grass / wood / stone / sand / carpet / mud / metal / candy: its footsteps and soft, metal and plate
//   impacts): "Impact Sounds" by Kenney (kenney.nl), CC0 (the pack's License.txt)
//     https://kenney.nl/assets/impact-sounds
//   engine (La Guagua's hum, looped and pitched down): "racing car engine sound loops" by domasx2, CC0 (remade from a public domain sample), loop_0
//     https://opengameart.org/content/racing-car-engine-sound-loops
//   brake (La Guagua pulling up): "auto car or van stop brake skid gravel short" by kyles, CC0
//     https://freesound.org/people/kyles/sounds/637161/
//   the bosses' voices (vox_<boss>_<attack|jump|hurt|stagger|taunt|ko>, 22.05 kHz; 2026-10-28; src/bossvoice/SOURCES.md has every page):
//     Lossst: Volvion's RPG Voices (strong man noises, man carrying or attacking, jumping, hurt), FuzzyTuesday "Groans from a Man", IENBA "Big Character Grunts"
//     Glos: mvVoiceActing's "Woman Voice" pack (wicked witch / tough girl battle sounds, evil girl dialogue, girl taking damage), Soundjougi "Woman's Final Gasps"
//     all Freesound, "Creative Commons 0"
// (They all say credit is appreciated, not required.) Each take is trimmed to its attack, faded out and normalized to -1 dBFS; the game sets the levels.
